graph TB
    subgraph ExtProc["ext-proc gRPC Server (port 9004)"]
        direction TB
        DynMeta["DynamicMetadata Wrapper<br/>(gRPC interceptor)"]

        subgraph Pipeline["IPP Plugin Pipeline"]
            direction TB
            HeadersGuard["maas-headers-guard"]
            BodyField["body-field-to-header"]
            Resolver["model-provider-resolver"]
            StreamUsage["stream-usage-enforcer"]
            ApiTranslation["api-translation"]
            ApiKeyInj["apikey-injection"]
            NemoReq["nemo request guard<br/>(optional)"]
            NemoResp["nemo response guard<br/>(optional)"]
            ExtMetering["external-metering"]
        end

        HealthSvc["Health Service<br/>(port 9005)"]
    end

    subgraph Controllers["Kubernetes Controllers"]
        direction TB
        ExtModelCtrl["ExternalModel Controller"]
        ExtProvCtrl["ExternalProvider Controller"]
        LegacyCtrl["Legacy Migration Controller"]
    end

    subgraph CRDs["Custom Resource Definitions"]
        ExtModelCR["ExternalModel CR<br/>(inference.opendatahub.io/v1alpha1)"]
        ExtProvCR["ExternalProvider CR<br/>(inference.opendatahub.io/v1alpha1)"]
        LegacyCR["ExternalModel CR<br/>(maas.opendatahub.io/v1alpha1)"]
    end

    Envoy["Envoy Proxy<br/>(AI Gateway)"] -->|gRPC ExtProc callout| DynMeta
    DynMeta --> Pipeline

    ExtModelCR -->|watched by| ExtModelCtrl
    ExtModelCR -->|watched by| Resolver
    ExtProvCR -->|watched by| ExtProvCtrl
    ExtProvCR -->|watched by| Resolver
    LegacyCR -->|watched by| LegacyCtrl

    ExtModelCtrl -->|creates/updates| HTTPRoute["HTTPRoute<br/>(gateway.networking.k8s.io)"]
    ExtProvCtrl -->|creates| ExtNameSvc["ExternalName Service"]
    ExtProvCtrl -->|creates| ServiceEntry["Istio ServiceEntry"]
    ExtProvCtrl -->|creates| DestRule["Istio DestinationRule"]
    LegacyCtrl -->|migrates to| ExtModelCR
    LegacyCtrl -->|migrates to| ExtProvCR

    ApiKeyInj -->|reads| Secrets["Kubernetes Secrets<br/>(provider credentials)"]
    Resolver -->|sets| RoutingHeader["x-ipp-selected-provider<br/>header"]
    DynMeta -->|converts pseudo-headers to| EnvoyMeta["Envoy DynamicMetadata"]

    Envoy -->|routes via HTTPRoute| LLMProvider["External LLM Providers<br/>(OpenAI, Anthropic, Azure,<br/>Bedrock, Vertex AI)"]

    style ExtProc fill:#4a90e2,color:#fff
    style Pipeline fill:#e8f0fe,stroke:#4a90e2
    style Controllers fill:#d5e8d4,stroke:#82b366
    style CRDs fill:#fff2cc,stroke:#d6b656
    style Envoy fill:#f5a623,color:#fff
    style LLMProvider fill:#999,color:#fff
    style DynMeta fill:#4a90e2,color:#fff
    style Resolver fill:#4a90e2,color:#fff
    style ApiKeyInj fill:#4a90e2,color:#fff
    style ApiTranslation fill:#4a90e2,color:#fff
    style NemoReq fill:#4a90e2,color:#fff
    style NemoResp fill:#4a90e2,color:#fff
    style HeadersGuard fill:#4a90e2,color:#fff
    style StreamUsage fill:#4a90e2,color:#fff
    style ExtMetering fill:#4a90e2,color:#fff
    style BodyField fill:#4a90e2,color:#fff
    style HealthSvc fill:#4a90e2,color:#fff
